"34","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 34 Arabic Hadees: 467"
"35","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 35 Arabic Hadees: 3957"
"36","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 36 Arabic Hadees: 467"
"37","Al-Silsila-tu-Ahadees-e-Sahiha Hadees: 37 Arabic Hadees: 3566"
"38","Come, pledge allegiance to me on the condition that you do not associate anything with Allah, nor steal, nor commit adultery, nor kill your children, nor bring forth a slander you fabricate between your hands and feet, nor disobey me in what is right. Whoever among you fulfills this, his reward is with Allah. Whoever commits any of these and is punished for it in this world, that will be an expiation for him. Whoever commits any of these and Allah conceals it, his matter is with Allah: if He wills, He will punish him, and if He wills, He will forgive him."
